about=pagehero('Technology with a business purpose.','Based in Abuja, LUTERA TECHNOLOGIES brings together IT and AI solutions, software development, hardware supply and practical technology consulting around your business needs.','About LUTERA','About')+'<section><div class="wrap split"><div>'+eye('Our story')+'<h2>Moving organizations forward, one decision at a time.</h2><p>From improving a business process to connecting systems or equipping a workplace, LUTERA brings technology conversations together. We help organizations define their requirements and consider suitable options.</p><p>Our work spans AI solutions and agents, business process automation, software design and implementation, data analytics, systems integration and cloud-based solutions. We also provide technology consultancy, hardware procurement and supply, installation, maintenance and technical support. Project scope, equipment availability and delivery arrangements are confirmed for each enquiry.</p></div>'+art+'</div></section><section class="pale"><div class="wrap two-cards"><article class="card">'+eye('Our mission')+'<h2>Make technology simpler.</h2><p>To simplify how organizations adopt, build, source and support technology through practical AI and software solutions, dependable hardware, clear consulting and responsive technical services.</p></article><article class="card">'+eye('Our vision')+'<h2>Build a more connected future.</h2><p>To become a trusted leader in technology solutions across Africa, enabling organizations to thrive through accessible, reliable and forward-looking technology.</p></article></div></section><section><div class="wrap">'+eye('What guides us')+'<h2>Our values, in practice.</h2><div class="values">'+''.join('<div class="card"><h3>'+t+'</h3><p>'+d+'</p></div>' for t,d in [('Integrity','Be clear, honest and accountable.'),('Quality','Pay attention to the details that matter.'),('Customer focus','Start with the organization’s real needs.'),('Innovation','Stay open to better ways of working.'),('Excellence','Keep improving how we serve.')])+'</div><p class="notice" style="margin-top:30px">LUTERA TECHNOLOGIES LTD is the working brand. Incorporation is pending; no company registration or certification is claimed on this website.</p></div></section>'+cta()
servicepage=pagehero('Technology services.<br>Business-focused thinking.','Explore AI and automation, software development, data analytics, cloud and systems integration, alongside technology consulting, hardware procurement and support.','Our services','Services')+'<section><div class="wrap">'+servicecards()+'</div></section>'+digital_services(BASE)+cta()
