legal={
 'privacy':('Privacy notice','How we handle your enquiry.', [('Who to contact','LUTERA TECHNOLOGIES is the working brand behind this website; incorporation is pending. For privacy questions, access, correction or deletion requests, contact chimaster010@gmail.com.'),('Information you provide','Quote enquiries request your organization, contact name, email, category and requirements. Phone, budget, location, timing and notes are optional, except quantities for equipment enquiries. The contact form asks for your name, email and message, with organization optional. Do not submit passwords, payment details or sensitive documents.'),('Purpose and basis','We use the information you send to clarify requirements, prepare quotations and respond to your business enquiry. Processing supports steps you request before a contract and our legitimate interest in responding to business enquiries, subject to applicable law. Acknowledging this notice is separate from marketing consent. This website does not collect marketing subscriptions.'),('Email processing and service providers','Both forms send the submitted fields to FormSubmit, which processes them and routes them to chimaster010@gmail.com. FormSubmit is a third-party form service, not a database operated by LUTERA. It may retain submissions or technical logs under its own policy. Review <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit’s privacy policy</a>. Its spam-prevention checks may use Google reCAPTCHA. Email is processed by Google’s Gmail service. GitHub Pages serves this website and may process request information. Fonts are hosted with the website, without requests to Google Fonts. Clicking WhatsApp opens a separate third-party service.'),('Access, retention and international processing','Enquiries are reviewed through the business email inbox. Information is retained only as needed for the enquiry, an agreed transaction and relevant legal obligations. You can request deletion using the contact email; third-party providers may retain logs or backups according to their policies. Providers may process information outside Nigeria. No private customer account or RFQ database is operated by this website.'),('Your rights','Contact the email above to request access, correction, deletion or information about processing. Applicable rights and exceptions depend on law, including the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023. You may also contact the Nigeria Data Protection Commission. This notice describes the workflow and does not claim certification or automatic legal compliance.'),('Website storage and updates','The website uses no advertising analytics or administrator login. The public pages do not store enquiry details in browser storage. Spam-prevention services may use their own cookies on the submission page. Last updated: 16 October 2026.')]),
 'terms':('Website terms','Clear expectations for business enquiries.', [('Use of the website','This website provides information about LUTERA TECHNOLOGIES and accepts business enquiries. The working brand is LUTERA TECHNOLOGIES LTD; incorporation is pending. Website content does not assert registration, certification, reseller authorization or a formal relationship with any equipment manufacturer.'),('Quotations and orders','A form submission, email or WhatsApp message is a request for information or quotation. It is not an order, acceptance, reservation of stock or supply contract. Prices, specifications, availability, warranty, service scope, payment and delivery terms must be confirmed in a written quotation and agreed separately.'),('Service information','Product categories are illustrative of enquiry areas. Technical support, installation and maintenance are scoped individually. Do not assume response times, on-site coverage or service level guarantees unless agreed in writing.'),('Your responsibilities','Provide accurate information and avoid submitting confidential, unlawful or malicious material. Do not attempt to access private RFQ records, bypass authentication or disrupt the website.'),('Content and availability','We aim to keep information accurate and the website available, but details may change and errors or interruptions may occur. Nothing in these terms excludes rights or liabilities that applicable law does not allow to be excluded. Third-party websites and services have their own terms.'),('Contact','Questions about this website or a procurement enquiry can be sent to chimaster010@gmail.com. These website terms do not replace an individually agreed supply or service contract. Last updated: 16 October 2026.')]),
 'cookies':('Cookies & local storage','A small, practical footprint.', [('Public website','The public pages do not set advertising or analytics cookies and do not store enquiry details in browser local storage. There is no customer or administrator login.'),('Form submissions','Sending a form takes you to FormSubmit for processing and spam prevention. Its service and Google reCAPTCHA may use cookies or similar technology. Read <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit’s privacy policy</a> for details.'),('Other providers','GitHub Pages serves the website. Fonts are served directly with the website. Opening WhatsApp moves the conversation to that service. These providers process technical requests under their own policies.'),('Your controls','Browser settings let you clear or block cookies. Blocking spam-prevention functionality may prevent form submission; you can instead email chimaster010@gmail.com directly. Last updated: 16 October 2026.')])}

